  // ============================================================
  // D. PUBLISH PIPELINE  (requirement 3)
  // ============================================================
  // examPublishResults() already performs the lock check, sets
  // isPublished/publishedAt, writes to the Audit Log, and fires ONE
  // 'exam.result.published' event per student via Dnyanankur.Event.
  // Phase 2 hooks version + snapshot creation onto that SAME event
