  // INSTALL — additive only. Extends (never replaces)
  // global.AcademicEngine.Compare with ONE new method,
  // compareClassResults. Every existing Compare member (.run,
  // .runFull, .runAllClasses, .compareStudent, .compareClass,
  // .compareExam from EXAM-2.1/2.3/2.39) is preserved untouched.
  // ============================================================
