  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // Dnyanankur.Services.Attendance
  //
  // Scope of Phase 22: relocate ONLY verified-pure Attendance business
  // logic (no document.*, no window.* DOM/browser APIs, no innerHTML,
  // no alert/confirm/toast/wfToast, no modal ops, no render*, no UI
  // routing, no DOM reads/writes). Each method here is a byte-for-byte
  // move of an existing function's body from the Sprint 6.5A
