  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // Dnyanankur.Services.Finance  (Phase 36 — Finance Core)
  //
  // Scope: implement ONLY the FinanceService that Phases 31–33
  // already call defensively (window.Dnyanankur && Dnyanankur.Services
  // && Dnyanankur.Services.Finance && typeof ...financeCreateTransaction
  // === "function"). Those three call sites are untouched — this
